{"seq":6,"slug":"ai-narrative","title":"AI 时代的叙事","stage":"DONE","category":"storytelling-narrative","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/storytelling-narrative/ai-narrative","rating":{"composite":3.6,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.11,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introMarkdown":"# AI 时代的叙事\n\n2022年末 ChatGPT 的爆发像一颗叙事领域的深水炸弹——它不仅改变了人们\"如何写作\"，更从根本上动摇了\"谁在讲故事\"这一千年未变的基本假设。在此之前，叙事是人类最独有的能力之一：从洞穴壁画到荷马史诗，从莎士比亚到Netflix，故事的起源始终是一颗人类的大脑。而现在，大语言模型可以在几秒内生成一篇小说开头、一段剧本对话、甚至一整套世界观设定——这些内容在盲评中越来越难以与人类创作区分。\n\n这不是简单的\"工具升级\"。打字机替代了手写，但不改变写作的本质；字处理器让编辑更高效，但不参与创作决策。AI 写作工具则不同——它们**参与叙事决策本身**：建议情节走向、生成角色对话、提出结构调整方案。当工具开始拥有\"叙事判断力\"时，创作者与工具之间的边界就变得模糊了。\n\n本知识库从四个维度展开这场正在发生的变革。第一章聚焦**AI 写作工具**——从 ChatGPT、Claude 到 Sudowrite，大语言模型如何改变创意写作的工作流，以及面向叙事的提示工程如何成为一种新型\"写作技巧\"。第二章深入**计算叙事**——程序化叙事生成的技术前沿、AI 互动小说的涌现、以及叙事智能作为学术领域的最新进展。第三章探讨**人机共创**——当人类和 AI 一起讲故事时，共创的模式是什么？署名权和真实性如何界定？受众体验又发生了怎样的变革？第四章展望**未来叙事**——合成媒体与深度伪造对叙事信任的冲击、个性化叙事的无限可能、以及 AI 叙事不可回避的伦理问题。\n\nAI 不会取代人类讲故事。但它正在深刻改变故事被创造、传播和体验的方式。理解这场变革——它的可能性、局限性和伦理边界——是每一个关心叙事的人在这个时代的必修课。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ai-writing-tools","title":"AI 写作工具","docCount":3,"url":"/h/storytelling-narrative/ai-narrative/ai-writing-tools","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"llm-creative-writing","title":"大语言模型与创意写作","url":"/h/storytelling-narrative/ai-narrative/ai-writing-tools/llm-creative-writing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ai-assisted-workflow","title":"AI 辅助写作工作流","url":"/h/storytelling-narrative/ai-narrative/ai-writing-tools/ai-assisted-workflow"},{"seq":3,"slug":"prompt-engineering-narrative","title":"面向叙事的提示工程","url":"/h/storytelling-narrative/ai-narrative/ai-writing-tools/prompt-engineering-narrative"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"computational-narrative","title":"计算叙事","docCount":3,"url":"/h/storytelling-narrative/ai-narrative/computational-narrative","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"procedural-generation","title":"程序化叙事生成","url":"/h/storytelling-narrative/ai-narrative/computational-narrative/procedural-generation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"interactive-fiction-ai","title":"AI 互动小说","url":"/h/storytelling-narrative/ai-narrative/computational-narrative/interactive-fiction-ai"},{"seq":3,"slug":"narrative-intelligence","title":"叙事智能研究","url":"/h/storytelling-narrative/ai-narrative/computational-narrative/narrative-intelligence"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"human-ai-collaboration","title":"人机共创叙事","docCount":3,"url":"/h/storytelling-narrative/ai-narrative/human-ai-collaboration","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"co-creation-models","title":"人机共创模式","url":"/h/storytelling-narrative/ai-narrative/human-ai-collaboration/co-creation-models"},{"seq":2,"slug":"authorship-authenticity","title":"署名权与真实性","url":"/h/storytelling-narrative/ai-narrative/human-ai-collaboration/authorship-authenticity"},{"seq":3,"slug":"audience-experience","title":"受众体验变革","url":"/h/storytelling-narrative/ai-narrative/human-ai-collaboration/audience-experience"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"future-narrative","title":"未来叙事形态","docCount":3,"url":"/h/storytelling-narrative/ai-narrative/future-narrative","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"synthetic-media","title":"合成媒体与深度伪造","url":"/h/storytelling-narrative/ai-narrative/future-narrative/synthetic-media"},{"seq":2,"slug":"personalized-narrative","title":"个性化叙事","url":"/h/storytelling-narrative/ai-narrative/future-narrative/personalized-narrative"},{"seq":3,"slug":"narrative-ethics-ai","title":"AI 叙事伦理","url":"/h/storytelling-narrative/ai-narrative/future-narrative/narrative-ethics-ai"}]}]}